Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.04,0:20:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.01,0:20:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Мен... Иә?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Мен...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.02,0:21:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ямада және...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.03,0:21:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,♬～
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.03,0:21:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Уау!
